H"],["stomach","живіт","zhih-VEET"],["hair","волосся","voh-LOS-sya"],["finger","палець","PAH-lets'"]]},{"id":"home","title":"Home","items":[["house","будинок","boo-DIH-nok"],["room","кімната","keem-NAH-tah"],["kitchen","кухня","KOOKH-nya"],["bathroom","ванна","VAHN-nah"],["door","двері","DVEH-ree"],["window","вікно","veek-NOH"],["table","стіл","steel"],["chair","стілець","stee-LETS'"],["bed","ліжко","LEEZH-ko"],["sofa","диван","dih-VAHN"],["lamp","лампа","LAHM-pah"],["key","ключ","klyooch"],["garden","сад","sahd"],["floor","підлога","peed-LOH-hah"],["wall","стіна","stee-NAH"]]},{"id":"clothes","title":"Clothes","items":[["shirt","сорочка","soh-ROCH-kah"],["trousers","штани","shtah-NIH"],["dress","сукня","SOOK-nya"],["skirt","спідниця","speed-NIH-tsya"],["shoes","взуття","vzoot-TYA"],["socks","шкарпетки","shkar-PET-kih"],["jacket","куртка","KOORT-kah"],["coat","пальто","pahl'-TOH"],["hat","капелюх","kah-peh-LYOOKH"],["glasses","окуляри","oh-koo-LYAH-rih"],["bag","сумка","SOOM-kah"],["pocket","кишеня","kih-sheh-NYAH"]]},{"id":"town","title":"Town","items":[["street","вулиця","VOO-lih-tsya"],["shop","магазин","mah-hah-ZIHN"],["market","ринок","RIH-nok"],["bank","банк","bahnk"],["hospital","лікарня","lee-KAR-nya"],["school","школа","SHKOH-lah"],["station","вокзал","vok-ZAHL"],["airport","аеропорт","ah-eh-roh-PORT"],["bus","автобус","ahv-TOH-boos"],["train","поїзд","POH-yeezd"],["car","автомобіль","ahv-toh-moh-BEEL'"],["bicycle","велосипед","veh-loh-sih-PED"],["taxi","таксі","tahk-SEE"],["restaurant","ресторан","res-toh-RAHN"],["bridge","міст","meest"],["park","парк","park"]]},{"id":"time","title":"Time","items":[["day","день","den'"],["night","ніч","neech"],["morning","ранок","RAH-nok"],["afternoon","після обіду","PEES-lya oh-BEE-doo"],["week","тиждень","TIHZH-den'"],["month","місяць","MEE-syats'"],["year","рік","reek"],["Monday","понеділок","poh-neh-DEE-lok"],["Tuesday","вівторок","veev-TOH-rok"],["Wednesday","середа","seh-reh-DAH"],["Thursday","четвер","cheht-VER"],["Friday","п'ятниця","PYAHT-nih-tsya"],["Saturday","субота","soo-BOH-tah"],["Sunday","неділя","neh-DEE-lya"],["January","січень","SEE-chen'"],["summer","літо","LEE-toh"],["winter","зима","zih-MAH"]]},{"id":"weather-and-nature","title":"Weather and nature","items":[["sun","сонце","SON-tseh"],["rain","дощ","dohshch"],["snow","сніг","sneeh"],["wind","вітер","VEE-ter"],["cloud","хмара","KHMAH-rah"],["hot","жарко","ZHAR-ko"],["cold","холодно","KHOH-lod-noh"],["sea","море","MOH-reh"],["river","річка","REECH-kah"],["mountain","гора","hoh-RAH"],["tree","дерево","DEH-reh-voh"],["flower","квітка","KVEET-kah"],["sky","небо","NEH-boh"]]},{"id":"work-and-school","title":"Work and school","items":[["teacher","вчитель","VCHIH-tel'"],["student","студент","stoo-DENT"],["book","книга","KNIH-hah"],["pen","ручка","ROOCH-kah"],["pencil","олівець","oh-lee-VETS'"],["paper","папір","pah-PEER"],["computer","комп'ютер","kom-PYOO-ter"],["phone","телефон","teh-leh-FON"],["work","робота","roh-BOH-tah"],["office","офіс","OH-fees"],["doctor","лікар","LEE-kahr"],["police officer","поліцейський","poh-lee-TSEY-s'kihy"],["lesson","урок","oo-ROK"],["exam","іспит","EES-piht"]]},{"id":"describing","title":"Describing","items":[["big","великий","veh-LIH-kihy"],["small","маленький","mah-LEN'-kihy"],["good","добрий","DOH-brihy"],["bad","поганий","poh-HAH-nihy"],["new","новий","noh-VIHY"],["old","старий","stah-RIHY"],["beautiful","гарний","HAR-nihy"],["ugly","негарний","neh-HAR-nihy"],["fast","швидкий","shvihd-KIHY"],["slow","повільний","poh-VEEL'-nihy"],["easy","легкий","LEH-hkihy"],["difficult","важкий","vahzh-KIHY"],["cheap","дешевий","deh-SHEH-vihy"],["expensive","дорогий","doh-roh-HIHY"],["clean","чистий","CHIHS-tihy"],["dirty","брудний","brood-NIHY"]]},{"id":"common-verbs","title":"Common verbs","items":[["to be","бути","BOO-tih"],["to have","мати","MAH-tih"],["to go (on foot)","йти","ytih"],["to want","хотіти","khoh-TEE-tih"],["to eat","їсти","YEES-tih"],["to drink","пити","PIH-tih"],["to speak","говорити","hoh-voh-RIH-tih"],["to see","бачити","BAH-chih-tih"],["to come","приходити","prih-KHOH-dih-tih"],["to give","давати","dah-VAH-tih"],["to know","знати","ZNAH-tih"],["to do / make","робити","roh-BIH-tih"],["to say","казати","kah-ZAH-tih"],["to like","любити","lyoo-BIH-tih"],["to live","жити","ZHIH-tih"],["to work","працювати","prah-tsyoo-VAH-tih"],["to buy","купувати","koo-poo-VAH-tih"],["to read","читати","chih-TAH-tih"],["to write","писати","pih-SAH-tih"],["to sleep","спати","SPAH-tih"],["to learn","вчити","VCHIH-tih"],["to help","допомагати","doh-poh-mah-HAH-tih"],["to need","потребувати","poh-treh-boo-VAH-tih"],["to love","кохати","koh-KHAH-tih"]]}],"grammar":[{"id":"pronouns","title":"Pronouns","text":["Ukrainian often drops the pronoun, but learn them. ви is both formal \"you\" and plural \"you\"."],"rows":[["I","я","yah"],["you (informal)","ти","tih"],["he","він","veen"],["she","вона","voh-NAH"],["it","воно","voh-NOH"],["we","ми","mih"],["you (formal / plural)","ви","vih"],["they","вони","voh-NIH"]],"ex":[["I am a student","я студент","yah stoo-DENT"],["you are tall","ти високий","tih vih-SOH-kihy"],["she is my sister","вона моя сестра","voh-NAH moh-YAH sehs-TRAH"],["we are friends","ми друзі","mih DROO-zee"],["they are teachers","вони вчителі","voh-NIH VCHIH-teh-lee"]]},{"id":"singular-and-plural","title":"Singular and plural","text":["Masculine: add -и or -і (or -ы after hard consonants). Feminine -а → -и. Neuter -о → -а. Some words are irregular."],"rows":[["masculine","стіл → столи","steel → stoh-LIH"],["masculine","брат → брати","braht → BRAH-tih"],["feminine","книга → книги","KNIH-hah → KNIH-hih"],["feminine (soft)","неділя → неділі","neh-DEE-lya → neh-DEE-lee"],["neuter","вікно → вікна","veek-NOH → VEEK-nah"],["irregular","людина → люди","lyoo-DIH-nah → LYOO-dih"]],"ex":[["one table, tables","стіл, столи","steel stoh-LIH"],["one book, books","книга, книги","KNIH-hah KNIH-hih"],["one window, windows","вікно, вікна","veek-NOH VEEK-nah"],["one friend, friends","друг, друзі","drooh DROO-zee"],["one child, children","дитина, діти","dih-TIH-nah DEE-tih"]]},{"id":"to-be","title":"Бути: to be","text":["In the present tense \"to be\" is usually dropped: Я студент. (I am a student). Use є for \"there is\" or for emphasis."],"rows":[["I am","я є / (omitted)","yah ye"],["you are","ти є / (omitted)","tih ye"],["he / she is","він / вона є / (omitted)","veen ye"],["we are","ми є / (omitted)","mih ye"],["they are","вони є / (omitted)","voh-NIH ye"]],"ex":[["I am English","я англієць","yah ahn-HLEE-yets'"],["he is a doctor","він лікар","veen LEE-kahr"],["we are tired","ми втомлені","mih VTOM-leh-nee"],["are you from Kyiv?","ти з Києва?","tih z KIH-yeh-vah"],["they are at home","вони вдома","voh-NIH VDOH-mah"]]},{"id":"to-have","title":"Мати: to have","text":["Usually said as \"at me there is\": У мене є."],"rows":[["I have","у мене є","oo MEH-neh ye"],["you have","у тебе є","oo TEH-beh ye"],["he has","у нього є","oo NYOH-hoh ye"],["she has","у неї є","oo neh-YEE ye"],["we have","у нас є","oo nahs ye"],["they have","у них є","oo nihkh ye"]],"ex":[["I have a brother","у мене є брат","oo MEH-neh ye braht"],["she has two cats","у неї два коти","oo neh-YEE dvah koh-TIH"],["we have time","у нас є час","oo nahs ye chahs"],["do you have a pen?","у тебе є ручка?","oo TEH-beh ye ROOCH-kah"],["they have a car","у них є машина","oo nihkh ye mah-SHIH-nah"]]},{"id":"regular-verbs-present-tense","title":"Regular verbs (present tense)","text":["Verbs end in -ти. Many have -ю, -єш, -є, -ємо, -єте, -ють. Працювати (to work):"],"rows":[["я","працюю","prah-TSYOO-yoo"],["ти","працюєш","prah-TSYOO-yesh"],["він / вона","працює","prah-TSYOO-yeh"],["ми","працюємо","prah-TSYOO-yeh-moh"],["ви","працюєте","prah-TSYOO-yeh-teh"],["вони","працюють","prah-TSYOO-yoot'"]],"ex":[["I work in a bank","я працюю в банку","yah prah-TSYOO-yoo v BAHN-koo"],["you live in Kyiv","ти живеш у Києві","tih zhih-VESH oo KIH-yeh-vee"],["she reads a book","вона читає книгу","voh-NAH chih-TAH-yeh KNIH-hoo"],["we learn Ukrainian","ми вчимо українську","mih VCHIH-moh oo-krah-YEEN-s'koo"],["they buy bread","вони купують хліб","voh-NIH koo-POO-yoot' khleeb"]]},{"id":"to-go","title":"Йти: to go","text":["By transport: їхати (їду, їдеш...). Йти is on foot."],"rows":[["I go","я йду","yah ydoo"],["you go","ти йдеш","tih ydesh"],["he / she goes","він йде","veen YDEH"],["we go","ми йдемо","mih YDEH-moh"],["you go (pl)","ви йдете","vih YDEH-teh"],["they go","вони йдуть","voh-NIH ydoot'"]],"ex":[["I am going to school","я йду до школи","yah ydoo doh SHKOH-lih"],["where are you going?","куди ти йдеш?","koo-DIH tih ydesh"],["we are going home","ми йдемо додому","mih YDEH-moh doh-DOH-moo"],["she is going shopping","вона йде за покупками","voh-NAH YDEH zah poh-KOOP-kah-mih"],["let's go!","ходімо!","khoh-DEE-moh"]]},{"id":"basic-sentences","title":"Basic sentences","text":["Word order is flexible: usually subject, verb, object. Adjectives come before the noun and agree with it."],"rows":[["subject + verb + object","Я їм хліб.","yah yeem khleeb"],["adjective before noun","великий будинок","veh-LIH-kihy boo-DIH-nok"],["add time or place","Я працюю тут сьогодні.","yah prah-TSYOO-yoo toot s'oh-HOD-nee"]],"ex":[["I eat bread","я їм хліб","yah yeem khleeb"],["Anna reads a book","Анна читає книгу","AHN-nah chih-TAH-yeh KNIH-hoo"],["we live in a big house","ми живемо у великому будинку","mih zhih-VEH-moh oo veh-LIH-koh-moo boo-DIN-koo"],["he works here today","він сьогодні працює тут","veen s'oh-HOD-nee prah-TSYOO-yeh toot"],["the dog is black","собака чорна","soh-BAH-kah CHOR-nah"]]},{"id":"negation","title":"Negation","text":["Put не before the verb. Double negatives are normal: Я нічого не хочу."],"rows":[["not","не + verb","neh"],["nothing","нічого","nee-CHOH-hoh"],["nobody","ніхто","nee-KHTOH"],["never","ніколи","nee-KOH-lih"]],"ex":[["I do not speak French","я не розмовляю французькою","yah neh roz-moh-VLYAH-yoo frahn-TSOOZ'-koh-yoo"],["she does not live here","вона тут не живе","voh-NAH toot neh zhih-VEH"],["I do not want anything","я нічого не хочу","yah nee-CHOH-hoh neh KHOH-choo"],["nobody is here","тут нікого немає","toot nee-KOH-hoh neh-MAH-yeh"],["I never eat meat","я ніколи не їм м'яса","yah nee-KOH-lih neh yeem MYAH-sah"]]},{"id":"asking-questions","title":"Asking questions","text":["Yes or no: raise your voice, or start with чи."],"rows":[["statement","Ти говориш англійською.","tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["question with чи","Чи ти говориш англійською?","chih tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["rising voice","Ти говориш англійською?","tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"]],"ex":[["do you speak English?","чи ти говориш англійською?","chih tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["is she a doctor?","чи вона лікар?","chih voh-NAH LEE-kahr"],["do you have a pen?","чи є в тебе ручка?","chih ye v TEH-beh ROOCH-kah"],["are you tired?","ти втомився?","tih vtoh-MIH-vsya"],["is it far?","це далеко?","tseh dah-leh-KOH"]]},{"id":"question-words","title":"Question words","text":[],"rows":[["what","що","shchoh"],["who","хто","khtoh"],["where","де","deh"],["when","коли","koh-LIH"],["why","чому","choh-MOO"],["how","як","yahk"],["which","який","yah-KIHY"],["how much / how many","скільки","SKEEL'-kih"]],"ex":[["what is this?","що це?","shchoh tseh"],["who is she?","хто вона?","khtoh voh-NAH"],["where do you live?","де ти живеш?","deh tih zhih-VESH"],["when is the exam?","коли іспит?","koh-LIH EES-pit"],["why are you late?","чому ти запізнився?","choh-MOO tih zah-peez-NIH-vsya"],["how much is it?","скільки це коштує?","SKEEL'-kih tseh KOSH-too-yeh"]]},{"id":"possessives","title":"Possessives","text":[],"rows":[["my","мій / моя / моє","meey / moh-YAH / moh-YEH"],["your (informal)","твій / твоя / твоє","tveey / tvoh-YAH / tvoh-YEH"],["his","його","yoh-HOH"],["her","її","yeh-YEE"],["our","наш / наша / наше","nahsh / NAH-shah / NAH-sheh"],["your (formal / plural)","ваш / ваша / ваше","vahsh / VAH-shah / VAH-sheh"],["their","їхній / їхня / їхнє","YEEKH-neey"]],"ex":[["my house","мій дім","meey deem"],["your friends","твої друзі","tvoh-YEE DROO-zee"],["his sister","його сестра","yoh-HOH sehs-TRAH"],["our teacher","наш вчитель","nahsh VCHIH-tel'"],["my mother","моя мама","moh-YAH MAH-mah"]]},{"id":"formal-vs-informal","title":"Formal vs informal","text":["ти for friends, family and children. ви for strangers, elders, teachers, and always for more than one person. Add the name and patronymic when you want to be very polite."],"rows":[["you, informal","ти","tih"],["you, formal / plural","ви","vih"],["your, informal","твій","tveey"],["your, formal","ваш","vahsh"]],"ex":[["you speak (informal)","ти говориш","tih hoh-VOH-rihsh"],["you speak (formal)","ви говорите","vih hoh-VOH-rih-teh"],["how are you? (informal)","як ти?","yahk tih"],["how are you? (formal)","як ви?","yahk vih"],["thank you, Mr Ivanenko","дякую, пане Іваненко","DYAH-koo-yoo PAH-neh ee-vah-NEN-koh"]]},{"id":"past-and-future-simple","title":"Past and future (simple)","text":["Past: stem + -в (masculine), -ла (feminine), -ло (neuter), -ли (plural). Future: буду + infinitive."],"rows":[["I worked (m)","я працював","yah prah-tsyoo-VAHV"],["I worked (f)","я працювала","yah prah-tsyoo-VAH-lah"],["we worked","ми працювали","mih prah-tsyoo-VAH-lih"],["I will work","я буду працювати","yah BOO-doo prah-tsyoo-VAH-tih"]],"ex":[["yesterday I worked (m)","вчора я працював","VCHOH-rah yah prah-tsyoo-VAHV"],["she bought a book","вона купила книгу","voh-NAH koo-PIH-lah KNIH-hoo"],["I went home (m)","я пішов додому","yah pee-SHOV doh-DOH-moo"],["I will call you tomorrow","я зателефоную завтра","yah zah-teh-leh-FOH-noo-yoo ZAHV-trah"],["we will eat at eight","ми їстимемо о восьмій","mih YEES-tih-meh-moh oh vos'-MEEY"]]}],"name":"Ukrainian","id":"uk","badge":"Solid","note":"Written in Cyrillic, as you know it from Russian. The third column shows how to say it; capitals mark the stressed syllable."}